        output_value : object
            The ``value`` converted to the correct type (or just ``value`` if
            ``converted`` is False)
        converted : bool
            True if the conversion was actually performed, False otherwise.

        Raises
        ------
        ValueError
            If the input is not valid for this attribute.

        """
        return value, False

